Or an expert emergency room physician triaging patients.

16:46.160 --> 16:51.440
We naturally assume that an expert is someone who considers more possibilities than a novice.

16:51.660 --> 16:52.940
That's the common assumption.

16:53.240 --> 16:56.860
The novice looks at the chess board and sees three possible moves.

